            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Thank you for the super quick response. The content is\n````\ns1:/*,mb:*,ex:*/,://,b:#,:%,:XCOMM,n:>,fb:-,fb:•,n:|,\n````\nAnd I found the bad line in my own config files. I am sorry. Still, it might be worth merging the sanitizing code anyways as it would make the plugin more robust?",
